0..77 Comment "//! A Tarski universe written by hand: a datatype of codes and a decoder from"
78..154 Comment "//! codes to value types. The decode of a code over a binder is a value type"
155..235 Comment "//! over a neutral code, compared by its code; the decode of a code that runs to"
236..311 Comment "//! a quote is the quoted type. The arrow code decodes to the function type"
312..390 Comment "//! between its two decoded sides, so a function at a decoded arrow applies. A"
391..469 Comment "//! type a body quotes reads each binder where the body binds it, and a decode"
470..539 Comment "//! at its path type\'s carrier reads as it does in a binder\'s type. A"
540..620 Comment "//! constructor field may read the one before it, so a value packs with its code"
621..669 Comment "//! [MartinLof-1984-intuitionistic_type_theory]."
670..673 Comment "//!"
674..700 Comment "//! - see: #540 — `endo`"
701..729 Comment "//! - see: #583 — `byCode`"
730..758 Comment "//! - see: #590 — `onType`"
759..815 Comment "//! - cites: [MartinLof-1984-intuitionistic_type_theory]"
816..819 Comment "//!"
